; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강신청 시간 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"></span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- 2019</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">27</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"></span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- 10:00~23:59 (23:59:59</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">까지 학부수강신청 바로가기 서비스</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">□ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">27</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일 전체학년 수강신청기간에는 타학년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">타학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">에 개설된 강좌에 여석이 있을 경우 전산으로만 수강신청 가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년별 수강신청 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(3.6.~ 8.) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">에 신청한 과목 삭제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">변경 및 신규추가 신청 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">타학년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">타학과에 개설된 과목 수강신청은 교과목코드 직접입력하여 수강신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">강좌는 일부 강좌는 외국인 학생만 수강신청 가능 한국어</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">고급한국어</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기업윤리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(BD0014-02), </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">소비자행동론</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">BD0017-02)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">전공에 개설된 과목 중 강의시간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">/</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">강의실 내역이 없는 강좌는 원격강좌임</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 개시후 수강변경 및 수강정정으로 인한 수업 결손을 최소화 하고자 전체학년 수강신청 전에 일부 과목은 수강정원 조정 및 분반 추가개설</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">개설폐지 등 교과목 개설 내역이 변경될 수 있으니 확인 후 수강신청에 참고하시기 바람</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">개설교과목 조회 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학교홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">금오인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">-&gt;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학사정보</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">-&gt;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">개설과목안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">원스톱서비스 학부 개설과목 조회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강신청인원 초과 및 강의실 멀티미디어 장비유무 등의 사유로 강의실이 변경되는 강좌가 있을 수도 있으니 수업 전에 확인 필요함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기타 수강신청에 대한 자세한 사항은 학사안내 공지 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">“2019</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년도 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 수강신청 안내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">” </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">참조</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">□ </span><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강과목 변경신청서는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">6</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">부터 학과사무실로 제출바람</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강신청기간 동안 본인의 아이디 및 비밀번호 관리를 철저히 하여 수강신청 시 불미한 경우가 없도록 주의하시기 바라며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">악의적인 의도로 타인의 아이디를 사용하여 신청 또는 변경</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">삭제를 하는 경우 엄중히 처벌할 예정임</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">붙임 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강신청사이트 메뉴안내 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수강과목 변경신청서 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">끝</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
